# Alembic migration directory.
#
# - env.py reads DATABASE_URL from the environment and uses app.database.Base
#   as the autogenerate target.
# - For an existing SQLite DB already at the current schema, run:
#       alembic stamp 0001_baseline
#   so Alembic considers it up-to-date without trying to recreate the tables.
# - For a fresh PostgreSQL DB, run:
#       alembic upgrade head
